  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:370px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-Black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Explosion Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d1/Sebastian-shaw-attack-o.gif/revision/latest?cb=20150719221435\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Sebastian-shaw-attack-o\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d1/Sebastian-shaw-attack-o.gif/revision/latest?cb=20150719221435\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d1/Sebastian-shaw-attack-o.gif/revision/latest?cb=20150719221435 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d1/Sebastian-shaw-attack-o.gif/revision/latest?cb=20150719221435 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Sebastian-shaw-attack-o\" width=\"270\" height=\"151\" data-image-key=\"Sebastian-shaw-attack-o.gif\" data-image-name=\"Sebastian-shaw-attack-o.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Sebastian Shaw (X-Men First Class) absorbs an explosion caused by a rocket</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb explosions.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"That’s a spicy meatball!\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― The Mask (The Mask) after devouring a bomb that exploded inside of him.</dd></dl></div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb explosions and utilize it in some way</b>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Explosion_Manipulation\" title=\"Explosion Manipulation\">Explosion Manipulation</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FExplosion_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb explosions, while removing it from the source, into their body and use it in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by enhancing themself, gaining the drained power, using it as power source etc., either temporarily or permanently.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FExplosion_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Regeneration\" title=\"Absorbing Regeneration\">Absorbing Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Affinity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Affinity\">Affinity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Capacitor\" title=\"Capacitor\">Capacitor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Explosion_Immunity\" title=\"Explosion Immunity\">Explosion Immunity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energized_Body\" title=\"Energized Body\">Energized Body</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Metabolization\" title=\"Energy Metabolization\">Energy Metabolization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a> (limited to <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Explosion-based_Powers\" title=\"Category:Explosion-based Powers\">explosion</a>/volatility-based powers)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FExplosion_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Explosion_Manipulation\" title=\"Explosion Manipulation\">Explosion Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Kinetic Energy Absorption\">Kinetic Energy Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FExplosion_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May be limited to how much one can absorb.\n<ul><li>May be limited by size and strength of an explosion; <a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Explosion_Inducement\" title=\"Nuclear Explosion Inducement\">nuclear explosion</a>, for example is likely bit too much.</li></ul></li>\n<li>May have limited range, including touch only.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Anti_Storage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Anti Storage\">Anti Storage</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a> counter this power.</li>\n<li>May not be protected from the damage caused by the absorbed substance/energy.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FExplosion_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Parasites (<i>Charmed</i>)</li>\n<li>GORT (<i>The Day the Earth Stood Still</i> 2008 movie)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dragonball.fandom.com/wiki/Beerus\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dragonball:Beerus\">Beerus</a> (<i>Dragon Ball Super</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://fairytail.fandom.com/wiki/Natsu_Dragneel\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:fairytail:Natsu Dragneel\">Natsu Dragneel</a> (<i>Fairy Tail</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://jojo.fandom.com/wiki/Esidisi\">Esidisi</a> (<i>JoJo's Bizarre Adventure</i>)</li>\n<li>Firestorm (<i>Legends of Tomorrow</i>)</li>\n<li>Stanley Ipkiss/The Mask (<i>The Mask</i>)</li>\n<li>Samus Aran (<i>Metroid</i>)</li>\n<li>Sebastian Shaw (<i>X-Men</i> movies)</li>\n<li>Thanos (<i>Marvel Cinematic Universe</i>) via the Infinity Gauntlet</li>\n<li>Strange Supreme (<i>Marvel Cinematic Universe/What if...</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FExplosion_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Power Suit (<i>Metroid</i>)</li>\n<li>Impact Dial (<i>One Piece</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FExplosion_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%